      "widgets_values": [
        "## h3 768p 15s ref2va aliens staged turbo\n\n1. Install WeeTodd Nodes and restart ComfyUI.\n2. Download the H3 components listed below.\n3. Keep the relative Component Loader paths unchanged.\n4. Replace these input placeholders: `tall_white_reference_sheet.png`, `grey_alien_reference_sheet.png`.\n5. Queue the workflow after **H3 Preflight** succeeds.\n\n### H3 downloads\n\n- [Official MiniMax H3 partition, processor, tokenizer, and audio VAE](https://huggingface.co/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3)\n  Save the repository under `ComfyUI/models/MiniMax-H3`.\n\n### Required LoRA\n\n- [drbaph v4 step-600 EMA adapter](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora-ComfyUI/blob/main/minimax_h3_turbo_v4_step600_ema_pruned_comfyui.safetensors)\n- Save it as `ComfyUI/models/loras/minimax_h3_turbo_v4_step600_ema_pruned_comfyui.safetensors`.\n\nUse a genuine Ref2VA partition for strict Ref2VA workflows.\nDo not substitute FL2VA weights unless the workflow enables compatibility mode."
